WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:01.770
Do it.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.820
It's over!  Hurry up and 
bring the paramedics!

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:24.970
Aki Izayoi advances to the finals!

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.820
Aki Izayoi is the winner!

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:37.330
She successfully defeated Kodo Kinomiya, so 
she advances to the finals to face Yusei Fudo!

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.030
What did you learn from her cards?

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:44.090
Rejection and anger.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:48.370
However, she's still hiding something.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.750
Aki Izayoi…

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:05.510
We've confirmed that she's also a Signer.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:54.390
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:59.420
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:07.950
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.910
Break through even further

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:19.440
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:26.570
There's always only one truth

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:30.410
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:35.240
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:41.260
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:16.710
Final Match  The Soul Hidden Behind the Mask

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.300
It's a detestable mark!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:41.960
Why is it a detestable mark?  
What does the mark mean to you?

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:46.870
I hate people who have this mark.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.500
I hate them.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.750
Yusei!

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.720
So this is where you were!

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.340
It's almost time for the finals!

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:58.570
It's the witch!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.520
Hi there, Izayoi.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:13.300
Your duel was impressive.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:19.920
Before the finals, Director Godwin 
wants to talk and thank you.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.210
Can you please come with me?

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:25.710
Aki is tired.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.340
And you are?

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:34.960
Let's just say I'm Aki's guardian.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:39.770
Even though you've most likely already 
investigated everything about me.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:49.000
Aki has to regain her 
strength before the finals.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.970
Excuse us.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:10.000
They're such a phony secret organization.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.990
Where did you take Rally and my friends?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:19.300
You should think about 
the position you're in.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.140
Or else…

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.800
That witch is scary.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.110
She's not scary.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.460
What's wrong?

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.820
It hurts and throbs.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:44.080
My arm and soul feel like 
that when I look at her.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.480
Aki.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:10.870
You understand that by revealing ourselves in 
this tournament, we've greatly increased our risk.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:16.830
People like the ones you just met 
will keep trying to confuse you.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.410
They're wasting their time.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:24.750
My mission is to let the world know about 
the ideals of the Arcadia Movement.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.770
Their nonsensical words 
will never enter my ears.

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:34.110
Divine, you lead my heart 
in the proper direction.

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.740
Aki, you're smart.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:44.800
Iliaster's goal is to resurrect the Crimson 
Dragon, which is the symbol of evil.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:52.130
The people don't know that the Crimson 
Dragon will force the world to kneel before it.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:58.830
We're the only ones who know because 
we have god-given abilities.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.980
I know.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.030
It's almost time for the finals.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:08.640
Your opponent Yusei Fudo may 
also be part of Iliaster.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:12.420
But you'll be fine, Aki.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:20.600
After you defeat Yusei and Iliaster's puppet 
Jack, the people's jeers will change to cheers.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.500
It's almost time for our ideals to come true.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.240
Yes.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.150
The detestable mark...

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.260
Rejection and anger.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:58.540
Those two feelings are 
directs towards the mark.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:04.070
If Izayoi's one other emotion 
is hidden among them...

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:06.540
It hurts and throbs.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:11.960
My arm and soul feel like 
that when I look at her.

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:17.230
This mark is clearly binding us together.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:22.520
They've noticed that and 
are trying to use us.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:31.020
Even the people with Izayoi are 
using her because she's a Signer.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.320
We must not be used.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:42.960
In order to do that, I have to open her 
heart so that I can meet the real Izayoi.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:46.840
I have to use all my strength.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:52.450
I have to risk my entire 
life when I face Izayoi.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:57.900
And after this battle, you await.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.020
I'm going.

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:19.890
When you feel like you're 
succumbing to your own

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:22.890
power, this hair accessory 
will stabilize your power.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:26.420
You're going to win.  Now go.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:37.960
Beat the witch!

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.300
I'll root for that Satellite garbage!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.810
Smash the witch!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.190
They say such horrible things.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:48.250
The opponent is just an innocent child.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:53.800
However, she's instilling fear 
using her mysterious power.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:59.010
But if so many people are afraid of 
her, why is there such a large crowd?

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:01.780
Humans are cruel.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:07.170
Even if they know there's danger, 
they still want to watch.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:10.760
Since they hate her, they 
want to see her slaughtered.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:14.640
It's going to be a heartbreaking duel.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:24.400
I'm sorry.  The Arcadia people 
kept her under constant watch.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:30.170
There's no need to be 
impatient.  You mustn't hurry.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:33.650
Now let's enjoy the finals.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.600
How ironic.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:41.540
Izayoi is a member of Arcadia, 
a group that opposes us,

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:46.540
but she's going to end up doing 
something important for us.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:53.190
She's a suitable opponent for drawing 
out Yusei Fudo's potential as a Signer.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:57.500
She will become our assassin.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:00.870
I want to see it, King.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:08.130
I want to see the clash between your Red 
Dragon Archfiend and Yusei's Stardust Dragon.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:12.700
I want to feel the energy 
that it will release.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.170
When that time comes, I'll make you feel 
it until you can't take it anymore.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:19.610
Yusei…

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:29.800
I don't think you'll lose, but Aki Izayoi 
has power different than any duelist you've met.

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:40.030
It's finally time for the finals!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:44.180
The winner of the finals 
gets to challenge the King!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:50.370
Which one will get the chance to 
gain an audience with the King?

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:56.300
The first challenger is the 
black rose witch Aki Izayoi!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.390
Defeat the witch!

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.630
Sacrifice the witch!

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:08.900
Next is Satellite's shooting star Yusei Fudo!

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:21.740
Yusei, do your best!

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:22.910
Yusei!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.900
I'm getting excited.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.770
Yusei, be careful.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.230
So you're scared too.

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.020
I feel like something is going to happen…

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:47.870
Aki, show them your real 
power.  Our real power.

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:52.870
Every moment has led to this!

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:57.390
Duel of Fortune Cup finals!

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.090
Start!

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:00.520
Duel!

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:13.470
Duel!

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:19.820
My turn.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.260
I draw.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.680
I summon Wall of Ivy in defense position.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:30.080
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.550
My turn.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.420
I summon Speed Warrior.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.970
During the Battle Phase of the turn that

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:44.970
Speed Warrior is summoned, 
its attack points double.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:50.160
Speed Warrior attacks Wall of Ivy!

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:55.020
When Wall of Ivy is the target 
of attack, one Ivy Token is

00:13:55.020 --> 00:14:00.020
Special Summoned on to the opponent's 
field in defense position.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.790
Sonic Edge!

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:14.670
Whoa!  Aki Izayoi often uses the strategy of 
summoning a Token on to the opponent's field!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:18.230
What surprise does she have this time?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.580
This Token is…

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.840
I end my turn.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.220
My turn.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.470
I draw!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.540
I flip over my set card.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:31.550
I activate the Continuous Trap Cursed Ivy.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:34.400
Due to its effect, I can 
Special Summon one Ivy

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:38.400
monster from my graveyard 
in faceup defense position.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:42.100
I return Wall of Ivy.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:50.290
Cursed Ivy equips on to Wall of Ivy, and if it's 
removed from the field, the equipped monster is also destroyed.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.020
Wall of Ivy again…

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:56.190
She's planning to increase the 
number of Ivy Tokens on my field.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:02.860
When this is destroyed, the controller 
takes 300 points of damage.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.470
I end my turn.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.570
In the first two turns, they're 
both feeling each other out.

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:13.730
The crowd also looks to have calmed down.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:17.190
However, is this the calm before the storm?

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:19.210
My turn.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.960
I release the Warrior-Type Speed Warrior.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:28.300
That allows me to Special 
Summon Turret Warrior!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:35.930
Turret Warrior gains attack points equal to the 
attack points of the Warrior-Type monster that was released.

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:41.490
Turret Warrior attacks Wall of Ivy!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:49.670
When Wall of Ivy is the target of attack, one Ivy Token 
is Special Summoned on to your field in defense position.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.250
Revolving Shot!

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:02.460
Since Wall of Ivy was destroyed, 
Cursed Ivy is also destroyed.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.120
When this card is sent to the 
graveyard, two Ivy Tokens

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:10.120
are Special Summoned on to your 
field in defense position.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.950
She's planning to fill up my field.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.410
I end my turn.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.090
My turn.

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:21.100
I draw.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:25.430
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card Seed of Deception.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:30.880
I can Special Summon one Level 2-or-below 
Plant-Type monster from my hand.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.070
Appear, Dark Verger!

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:38.290
Then I release Dark Verger!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.580
That lets me Advance Summon Rose Tentacles!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:55.630
Rose Tentacles attacks Turret Warrior!

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.040
Thorn Whip!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:18.670
Yusei only took 100 points of damage to his 
life points.  Therefore, he didn't feel much pain!

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:19.870
I'm not done.

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.870
When the Battle Phase 
begins, Rose Tentacles can

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:29.870
attack again for every Plant-Type 
monster on your field.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.430
What?

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:33.880
That means she can keep attacking?

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:42.280
And when it destroys a Plant-Type monster 
in battle, you take 300 points of damage.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:48.790
Whoa!  There are four Plant-Type 
Ivy Tokens on Yusei's field!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:54.590
That means Aki Izayoi can 
attack four more times!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:58.680
Then due to Rose Tentacles's monster effect, 
Yusei will take 300 points of damage!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:03.280
And when Ivy Token is destroyed, 
he'll take 300 points of damage!

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:07.960
That means for every attack, he 
will take 600 points of damage!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.800
Yusei!

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:11.680
No way…  Four times?

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:13.110
Here it comes!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:17.730
Rose Tentacles attacks Ivy Token!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.410
Thorn Whip One!

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:30.160
Thorn Whip Two!

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:42.840
Yusei…

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.820
That's right, Aki.

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:55.570
Release your loneliness and pain 
along with your cursed words.

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.600
Yusei!

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:03.870
Yusei…

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:11.200
Thorn Whip Three!

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:20.610
Rejection and anger…

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:26.380
This pain is actually Izayoi's screams.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:29.150
However, I can sense it.

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:32.500
Your one other emotion.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:35.500
This is the final attack.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.970
Last Thorn Whip!

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.540
You…

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:17.450
Whoa!  Due to the explosions from Aki 
Izayoi's attacks, the stadium is in a huge panic!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.490
Like we thought, Aki Izayoi is…

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:22.130
A witch!

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:24.090
She really is a witch!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.790
Witch!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:41.130
My turn.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:46.820
I summon Shield Warrior in defense position.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:55.170
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:05.700
I finally know.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:11.890
I know your one other emotion that 
lies beyond rejection and anger.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:21.940
Aki Izayoi, you enjoy the 
power of destruction.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:25.790
You feel joy from that power.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:30.870
I enjoy destruction?

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:09.430
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:14.820
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:20.740
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:25.980
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:29.140
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:34.730
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:41.890
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:47.290
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:53.230
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:58.570
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:04.630
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.780 --> 00:23:14.050
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
